Package: com.cysxl.vaon
Name: Vaon
Version: 2.1.9
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
Conflicts: com.atar13.vaon
Replaces: com.atar13.vaon
Provides: com.atar13.vaon
Description: A fork of atar13's Vaon.
 Shows the battery of Bluetooth accessories in the app switcher.
 * keep disconnected & pinned devices on show.
 * show speakers & soundbars that report no battery level.
 * pick a custom glyph per device.
 * page through devices with page dots.
 * park a side module beside a floating dock in landscape.
 * apply settings without a respring.
Author: atar13, SingleKeycap, CySxL
Maintainer: CySxL
Icon: https://cysxl.github.io/icons/com.cysxl.vaon.png
Section: Tweaks
